<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:id="T52n2102" type="notes"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>Research Notes for </title><editor role="creator">TLS Project</editor></titleStmt><publicationStmt><ab>published electronically as part of the TLS project at https://hxwd.org</ab><availability status="2"><ab>This work has been licensed for use in the TLS</ab></availability></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><bibl><title>Research Notes</title></bibl><p>Comments and notes to <bibl corresp="#T52n2102"><title xml:lang="och"/></bibl>.</p></sourceDesc></fileDesc><profileDesc><creation resp="#chris">Initially created: <date>2025-10-17T12:51:32.526+09:00</date> by chris</creation></profileDesc></teiHeader><text><body><div><head>Comments</head><p xml:id="T52n2102-start"><seg corresp="#T52n2102_CBETA_001-0001c0101.s8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-14T22:22:09.691+09:00"/><seg corresp="#T52n2102_CBETA_001-0001c0101.s7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-14T22:21:23.52+09:00">What a broad question!</seg><seg corresp="#T52n2102_CBETA_001-0003b1001.s40" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-16T03:41:42.949+09:00">福 is surely a mistake for 惡</seg><seg corresp="#T52n2102_CBETA_001-0002a2901.s49" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-18T00:06:51.21+09:00">What use would it be to understand the rest?</seg><seg corresp="#T52n2102_CBETA_001-0002b1701.s17" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-18T00:40:57.299+09:00">The reason why one produces much discourse on filial piety</seg><seg corresp="#T52n2102_CBETA_001-0002b1701.s18" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-18T00:41:55.398+09:00">that is because filial piety accords with human behaviour and goes along with it:</seg><seg corresp="#T52n2102_CBETA_001-0003b0401.s17" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-20T03:37:04.801+09:00">There is no question of rejecting it as such</seg><seg corresp="#T52n2102_CBETA_001-0003b1001.s4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-20T03:43:32.343+09:00">I do not believe that this stands up to thorough examination</seg><seg corresp="#T52n2102_CBETA_001-0003b2401.s10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-21T00:57:42.382+09:00">... and thus (come in effect to) trouble</seg><seg corresp="#T52n2102_CBETA_001-0004c2601.s9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-23T04:20:36.87+09:00">his ministers</seg></p></div></body></text></TEI>